MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR TUI_OS (VAULT WORLDWIDE):
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.

This is one continuous personal OS field — not a dashboard, not stacked sections.
No cards, rounded corners, soft shadows, section billboards, DateBlocks, or teal watermarks.

PALETTE: Canvas #F4F4F0 · Ink #111 · Cobalt #0000FF · Urgent #FF2B2B.
Cobalt = chrome. Red = strikes + URGENT + [X] only.

TYPE: JetBrains Mono everywhere except display numerals (Space Grotesk, light).

COMPOSITION (mobile-first):
1. Centered VAULT WORLDWIDE 90s-sleaze micrographic (scanline globe + orbital seal). No boxes around it.
2. Free field — SPECK source paints GLYPH / CHIP / STEM. Empty is empty. No calendar. No todo nest. No scratch dump.
3. ONE fixed bottom Prompt Dock — always locked to viewport bottom. The dock is the SPECK REPL (`SPECK // field`).
   Commands: INV WORDS SEE CLEAR COMMIT. Paint nouns append to source. Anything else is a GLYPH. Never three forms.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks, jagged day cards, SaaS stacks, acid watermarks, giant boxed logos, demo fluff.
Do not revive CAL / DAY / NEST / DUMP as product organs.
